":"American (Traditional)","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"Bars","historical_business_count":5},{"category":"Nightlife","historical_business_count":5}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"kYhiXEFyOMCvuLLRMkMtJw","review_id":"E24osWDWToJmaBXYbR8iTg","date":"2015-06-15T20:41:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9387722015380859,"text_excerpt":"Stopped in to Lucy's looking for a good spot for food and to watch the NBA Finals. It was a great choice. Lucy's is not a tourist trap, its locally owned with great decor and vibe to it. Its a favorite for beautiful women tourists and locals alike. They offer great beer specials even on imports. The food was excellent. Calif/Mex style food featuring excellent chips and salsa that is not overpriced. The fish tacos are the star of the menu, some of the best that you can get in New Orleans. They also have boiled crawfish when in season and great outdoor seating. I will be back."},{"business_id":"kYhiXEFyOMCvuLLRMkMtJw","review_id":"uYoh0i15YIeZG7fVy6guCw","date":"2015-10-04T05:17:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9241201877593994,"text_excerpt":"Had a wonderful lunch with my daughter on day 1 of our trip to NOLA! To start we had Queso topped with Fried Crawfish tails, which was full of flavor, a little spicy but, not where I couldn't eat it or had to wash it down with water after each bite, it added to the wonderful flavor. We went on Monday, when the daily special is Red Beans and Rice, my daughter and I split an order, they were also delicious and just like I make at home. My absolute favorite food item that we ordered was the Pao Pao Shrimp Po 'Boy, the shrimp were fried perfectly, the bread was soft and the Pao Pao sauce pulled it all together. We wished that we had time to wait for them to open before we left for the airport..."},{"business_id":"kYhiXEFyOMCvuLLRMkMtJw","review_id":"sCamZaR-yL8c9rhkCsF4Yg","date":"2015-12-03T20:55:48","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.918619692325592,"text_excerpt":"We came here after a Pelicans game on a Tuesday night after watching my Grizzlies win (Go Grizz!), and decided after perusing a number of local spots open at 10:15pm on the Yelp! app, we decided to try Lucy's. My significant other has lived here for 6 years and had always wanted to try it, and I was getting hangry (anger resulting from prolonged hunger) so we decided to try it out! It's a hoppin' corner spot with a nice patio on the sidewalk and a large patio in the back/atrium area. Sadly, it was raining and chilly so we were sat at a table in the restaurant area in the room behind the rambunctious bar area. I wish I was in the mood to indulge in a few cocktails, because this definitely ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"kYhiXEFyOMCvuLLRMkMtJw","photo_id":"b-e_v-HvD2qqH-hZyj6N5Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/b-e_v-HvD2qqH-hZyj6N5Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8592647314071655},{"business_id":"kYhiXEFyOMCvuLLRMkMtJw","photo_id":"hTD9yJjt0el2X-ODTKrw9Q","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/hTD9yJjt0el2X-ODTKrw9Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7821595668792725},{"business_id":"kYhiXEFyOMCvuLLRMkMtJw","photo_id":"w9Qfz1j_6UEUwCesO1DLwg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/w9Qfz1j_6UEUwCesO1DLwg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7705729007720947}]},"notebook_case":null}
